        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"244b17c9-5ccf-435a-9bbe-e128dbc23bf8\",\"review_text\":\"this recent update is a pain. I have my own playlist but i cant edit it now and then music go mix everytime you play stupid update\"},{\"review_id\":\"24fa05df-6ce2-4d19-ace9-062b979c8c8f\",\"review_text\":\"New update ruined it bad.\"},{\"review_id\":\"9eef0990-cfa4-4989-82de-41dc4c5f60de\",\"review_text\":\"Saya udah pake 2 minggu premium demi dapat seminggu premium harga 800, mau sy klaim hari ini ko ga ada??? Lihat diklaim kemarin, maksudnya??? Ok, mgkn sy uninstall nanti spotify karena serasa ditipu yaaa\"},{\"review_id\":\"6fd38670-7d5c-4e1b-8617-e3342207e6ef\",\"review_text\":\"Jestli mas premium tak je to nejlepsi aplikace\"},{\"review_id\":\"2026640a-99d6-447e-ad10-39ff2d8256b2\",\"review_text\":\"I can't login nor create account for over a month now\"},{\"review_id\":\"8d4b3578-b50b-4d41-937c-d3931ac87341\",\"review_text\":\"Good wish it had an option to click on featured artists profiles from songs.\"},{\"review_id\":\"3d95c15f-ff46-4ed8-a023-e95bab2a469d\",\"review_text\":\"Loging problem 😡🤬\"},{\"review_id\":\"104b205c-3c28-4777-84e6-1416d534b909\",\"review_text\":\"6/19/17 Every update, every time I open spotify it crashes my phone, HTC One lastest Android update. Nothing else does it. This is my go-to app for all music and podcasts, but if this keeps up I'll need to find something more reliable. 9/22/22 - stop changing the navigation so it's harder to use in the car. The car thing is annoying I just want to be able to play a playlist on shuffle with 1 button not check shuffle is on THEN hit play. Damn y'all\"},{\"review_id\":\"06477069-24a3-4cfd-b9ff-0c3597b7b988\",\"review_text\":\"Hello play on awake 😄\"},{\"review_id\":\"bdd11b8a-aac6-4b22-ae16-03ba156cd2d2\",\"review_text\":\"This app sucks no Spotify should remove these new restrictions if they want more ratings\"},{\"review_id\":\"fa833406-e295-4300-ba4d-4e158a68eff2\",\"review_text\":\"It is an amazing app love it my hole family has Spotify\"},{\"review_id\":\"66922bbc-59a6-43b6-bac8-07d213244be9\",\"review_text\":\"great🤩❤️\"},{\"review_id\":\"d8424fff-da94-4de2-9500-4ac46177a57c\",\"review_text\":\"Worst app, if you don't buy their premium there are no songs to listen, there are just ads!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"f4d19abe-247e-46bd-9d38-23e6ecf404bf\",\"review_text\":\"Money paid app worst app😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"d074adfc-6ff3-4f93-a69f-0f0dcb17cc3f\",\"review_text\":\"when i renew my premium why it's keep buffering and no connection even my wifi is strength enough 😔😔\"},{\"review_id\":\"9a87bc86-4e02-4412-b9ba-ffaed0aa36f5\",\"review_text\":\"Nobody: Absolutely no one: Spotify: let's replace Enhance with smart shuffle.\"},{\"review_id\":\"d966ff3a-20ec-4db6-9672-0389b000eaba\",\"review_text\":\"Bro adsssss please 1 min ad and 1hr kk niceeee\"},{\"review_id\":\"343510d0-6e31-41b7-b07a-bcd07a40fb16\",\"review_text\":\"Om foo bro\"},{\"review_id\":\"49dc8526-4cdc-4e83-aa20-c6688dfb9dcd\",\"review_text\":\"Worst app. If i logout and login olit will not process wrf\"},{\"review_id\":\"b811e151-1e4a-4515-9e13-7cc0f3e90cba\",\"review_text\":\"Terrible Experience\"}]}"
